  "steps": [
    "Gently sauté the garlic (and onion) in olive oil until fragrant, without browning.",
    "Add the passata and salt, cover and simmer over medium heat for about 10 minutes until slightly thickened.",
    "Remove the garlic and stir in the basil.",
    "Make four wells in the sauce and crack an egg into each.",
    "Cover and cook 3–4 minutes for runny yolks or 7–8 minutes for firmer ones.",
    "Finish with pepper and serve with toasted bread for dipping."
